# Bulk/regeneratable data layers — never committed. Ignoring "dir/*" rather
# than "dir/" (and re-including README.md) so the lightweight layer READMEs
# survive: Git does not descend into a wholly-ignored directory to evaluate
# negation patterns, so "data/raw/" + "!data/raw/README.md" would silently
# drop the README too — this form avoids that trap.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
# The EPPO price-structure archive (data/raw/EPPO_PRICE_STRUCTURE/, ~54 MB of
# workbooks) is covered by the pattern above. Its manifest is deliberately NOT:
# the raw bytes are regeneratable from the official REST index, and the manifest
# is the only durable record of which media ID produced which checksum. It is
# ~1 MB, the largest tracked manifest, and that is a deliberate trade.
# Retrieval manifests (source_url, retrieved_at, sha256) are small JSONL
# metadata, not bulk data — commit them as evidence, same reasoning as
# data/mapping/ below. Task A1 (docs/task_a1_report.md) relies on this.
!data/raw/_manifests/
!data/raw/_manifests/**
data/interim/*
!data/interim/README.md
data/processed/*
!data/processed/README.md
data/features/*
!data/features/README.md
data/targets/*
!data/targets/README.md
data/model_input/*
!data/model_input/README.md

# Mapping tables ARE committed in full (small, hand-curated, code-like reference data)
!data/mapping/
!data/mapping/**

# Local environment / secrets
.env
*.local.yaml

# Standard Python/OS noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Python packaging / virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Test / lint / type-checker caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Trained model artifacts — binaries never committed, regenerated by the
# training pipeline; this also covers models/<horizon>/<model_version>/*.joblib
# (see docs/modeling_strategy.md §12). metadata.yaml, feature_list.yaml, and
# evaluation_report.md under models/ are small text and are NOT matched by
# any pattern below, so they ARE committed — same pattern as data/mapping/
# vs. data/raw/ above: commit the small curated artifact, ignore the bulk one.
*.pkl
*.joblib
models/**/*.bin
